### Rename an image (success - must be owner)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69adff6a8131420b51c935df
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImNodW5reWxvdmVyMjMiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzM3MjA3OTAsImV4cCI6MTc3MzgwNzE5MH0.r02iYGP39RUnss6zO6IaREcudgYxLmAfd5_EofMqs7g

{ "name": "New Image Name" }

